s to an enchanting outdoor environment where the soothing sounds of a cascading waterfall create a resort-like atmosphere. A custom-built pergola anchors the outdoor entertaining spaces, offering the perfect setting for elegant alfresco dinners, morning coffee, or tranquil evenings beneath the stars. At the heart of the home, the gourmet chef's kitchen is designed to inspire, featuring granite countertops, premium stainless steel appliances, a breakfast bar, and seamless integration with the dining room and sunroom. The flow between spaces creates an effortless environment for entertaining on both grand and intimate scales. The primary suite is a luxurious private haven, offering a spa-caliber bath complete with dual vanities, a deep soaking tub, and separate walk-in shower. Two additional bedrooms open directly to the backyard oasis, creating a unique connection to the home's natural setting. Additional highlights include a flexible bonus room ideal for a home office or wellness studio, direct-access two-car garage, dedicated laundry room, central HVAC, and security system. Located in one of Los Angeles' most sought-after canyon communities, this remarkable residence offers immediate access to scenic hiking trails, mountain biking adventures, and the unmatched serenity of Mandeville Canyon. A rare opportunity to experience a lifestyle defined by privacy, nature, and understated luxury.", "remarksLength": 2136, "listedBy": "Amy Black", "propertyTypeName": "Single Family Residential", "totalSqft": 2615, "history": [{"date": "2026-09-29", "event": "Listed for Rent", "price": 8500, "source": "CLAW"}, {"date": "2026-09-09", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 2250000, "source": "TheMLS"}, {"date": "2026-09-08", "event": "Listed", "price": 1250000, "source": "TheMLS"}, {"date": "2024-04-12", "event": "Sold (MLS)", "price": 2280000, "source": "TheMLS"}, {"date": "2024-04-12", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 2280000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "2024-02